        "id": 1000257
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-02-15T02:45:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Because it throws off the indexing in the later Propagate method. Currently propagate, when walking up to create the list, will have the same start point of a function. If we include the root block in the block stack, then it\u0027s offset from the blocks we walk to find the function which is just annoying.",
      "parentUuid": "7d3a0963_03848d07",
      "revId": "79c039d251871e99f359451291fed28c5792c9c2",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
