      "writtenOn": "2025-02-14T22:13:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If the block_stack was a `UniqueVector`, you could simply check if `block_stack_.Contains(ctrl_inst-\u003eBlock())` inside this loop to find the first matching block. Then you wouldn\u0027t need to store the whole path and try to match it later on.",
      "revId": "79c039d251871e99f359451291fed28c5792c9c2",
